  "ruleText": "Lot 7002.32 “Sheet” means a single piece of paper on which 3 or more bingo cards are printed and of a predetermined color used to distinguish it for use with a specific bingo game.\n\nSource. #13067, eff 6-26-20; ss by #14138, eff 11-27-24, EXPIRES: 11-27-34 (formerly Lot 7002.29)",
